[node name="Details" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="Docket" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-40, -300)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Docket"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The High Magistrate's docket[/b]

In an old man's careful hand, under today's date:
\"[i]Western Valley. Three years of tithe lost on the road and not one report of it from reeve, elder or captain. Losses that large are not hidden by accident. Who was paid to stay silent, and who did the paying?[/i]\"

Below, underlined twice: [i]Summon the Thornhaven ledger, if it exists.[/i]"
reexamine_text = "Who was paid to stay silent, and who did the paying?"

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/Docket"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_200x46")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/Docket"]
z_index = 10
visible = false
offset_left = -90.0
offset_top = -56.0
offset_right = 90.0
offset_bottom = -31.0
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "[E] Read the Docket"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="ArchiveGap" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(380, -50)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Examine the Shelves"
flag_to_set = "writ_archive_gap_found"
discovery_text = "[b]A gap in the archive[/b]

The Western Valley's tithe returns should sit here, year after year in green ribbon. Three years are missing.

In their place, an archive slip: \"[i]Withdrawn for copying. T. Vane, clerk.[/i]\" The date on it is eleven months old. Nothing in the copying room bears that name."
reexamine_text = "Three years withdrawn, eleven months ago, by T. Vane."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/ArchiveGap"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_70x90")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/ArchiveGap"]
z_index = 10
visible = false
offset_left = -90.0
offset_top = -56.0
offset_right = 90.0
offset_bottom = -31.0
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "[E] Examine the Shelves"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="SealedWrit" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-340, -196)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Clerk's Desk"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]A writ, ready-sealed[/b]

A writ of summons lies among the clerk's papers. The Lord Protector's signet is already pressed into the wax, but the name, the charge and the court are blank.

A note pinned to it, in a secretary's hand: \"[i]For use in the valley matter, should a quiet hearing be preferred to a public one.[/i]\""
reexamine_text = "A sealed writ with no name on it, for a quiet hearing."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/SealedWrit"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_150x44")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/SealedWrit"]
