[node name="DeedRegister" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(340, 240)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Open the Deed Register"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Register of ancient deeds[/b]

The Ashdown grant is here, copied out two centuries ago: \"[i]all the Western Valley from the Darkwood to the river, to House Ashdown and its heirs, saving the rights of freeholders.[/i]\"

The ink of the last clause is darker than the rest, as if someone has gone over it recently. Someone else has pressed a thumbnail into the margin beside the words [i]saving the rights[/i]."
reexamine_text = "Saving the rights of freeholders, re-inked recently."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/DeedRegister"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_90x70")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/DeedRegister"]
z_index = 10
visible = false
